# Formatted code output

`Util.Code` renders multi-line code in a readable block and applies syntax
highlighting for the selected language.

```csharp run
Util.Code("""
    SELECT u.Id, u.Name
    FROM Users AS u
    WHERE u.IsActive = 1;
    """, CodeLanguage.Sql).Dump("SQL");

Util.Code("""
    { "name": "Invoklet", "enabled": true }
    """, CodeLanguage.Json).Dump("JSON");

Util.Code("""
    <configuration>
      <appSettings />
    </configuration>
    """, CodeLanguage.Xml).Dump("XML");

Util.Code("""
    var result = await service.LoadAsync(cancellationToken);
    """, CodeLanguage.CSharp).Dump("C#");

Util.Code("Unformatted diagnostic output", CodeLanguage.PlainText).Dump("Plain text");
```
